%I A401123 #20 Oct 26 2026 20:56:17
%S A401123 1,2,38,81,739,1828,2286,4157,15129,15531,15927,18457
%N A401123 Numbers k such that the number formed by 1 followed by k copies of 81, (20*100^k - 9)/11, is prime.
%C A401123 The corresponding primes have 2*k+1 digits and are, by construction, strobogrammatic (A007597), palindromic (A002385), and undulating palindromic (A059758).
%e A401123 38 is a term since 1 followed by 38 copies of 81 (a 77-digit number) is prime.
%o A401123 (PARI) isok(k) = ispseudoprime((20*100^k-9)/11)
%Y A401123 Cf. A007597, A002385, A059758.
%K A401123 nonn,base,hard,more,new
%O A401123 1,2
%A A401123 _Leonardo Boulay_, Oct 15 2026
%E A401123 a(8)-a(12) from _Michael S. Branicky_, Oct 19 2026
